    "title": "Dalton Voters Unanimously Approve All Articles at Special Town Meeting - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sabrina Damms ,\n1 hours ago DALTON, Mass. — Some 53 voters unanimously approved all five articles on the special town meeting warrant on Wednesday. The meeting that lasted 30 minutes resulted in the authorization of funding for specific projects, addressed budget changes and the approval of the Central Berkshire Regional School District's regional agreement. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
